data: {"id": "73b870c4a7ea48b1-thinking-parallel_evidence-1469", "run_id": "73b870c4a7ea48b1", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 已采集事实（来自本轮工具与基线）\n\n1. **Pod 状态**：`workload` 当前 `STATUS=Running`，`READY=0/1`，容器 `app` 未就绪；重启计数为 0。\n2. **Readiness Probe 配置**（来自 `describe`）：\n   - `http-get http://:18081/ready`，delay=5s，timeout=1s，period=5s，#success=1，#failure=1。\n3. **Readiness Probe 失败原文**（来自 `describe` 事件与 `events`）：\n   - `Readiness probe failed: Get \"http://172.16.104.33:18081/ready\": dial tcp 172.16.104.33:18081: connect: connection refused`（持续约 28 分钟，320 次）。\n4. **应用侧监听事实**（来自 `kubectl_logs`）：\n   - 日志仅显示 `listening on 1808", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789388147019, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

